...with our correspondent in the Vatican.

2393
02:12:46,542 --> 02:12:50,170
Extreme weather events
are taking a toll...

2394
02:12:50,171 --> 02:12:52,839
...in Tabasco, Chiapas
and Veracruz the floods...

2395
02:12:52,840 --> 02:12:56,677
...have left more than 600
dead and dozens missing.

2396
02:12:57,678 --> 02:13:00,096
Violence is unstoppable...

2397
02:13:00,097 --> 02:13:03,725
...there were shoot outs
today in three states...

2398
02:13:03,726 --> 02:13:06,687
...with 64 casualties.

2399
02:13:07,188 --> 02:13:10,023
In international news protest continue...

2400
02:13:10,024 --> 02:13:12,525
...in Europe due to
adjustments decreed by...

2401
02:13:12,526 --> 02:13:14,903
...the International Monetary Fund.

2402
02:13:14,904 --> 02:13:17,822
In finance, the Secretary
of Finance announced...

2403
02:13:17,823 --> 02:13:19,699
...a new bank rescue plan...

2404
02:13:19,700 --> 02:13:21,701
...and the peso and stock market suffered...

2405
02:13:21,702 --> 02:13:23,704
...strategic negative adjustments.

2406
02:13:24,288 --> 02:13:27,290
In sports, all the goals
from today's matches...

2407
02:13:27,291 --> 02:13:28,334
...and more.

2408
02:13:29,793 --> 02:13:32,629
This is 24 hours in 30 minutes...

2409
02:13:32,630 --> 02:13:35,006
...up next the detailed information...

2410
02:13:35,007 --> 02:13:36,841
...but before a brief message from...

2411
02:13:36,842 --> 02:13:38,260
...our sponsors.

2412
02:13:45,184 --> 02:13:47,018
OUR DIFFERENCES DIVIDE US

2413
02:13:47,019 --> 02:13:47,853
CELMEX

2414
02:13:48,020 --> 02:13:49,313
BRINGING MEXICO TOGETHER

2415
02:13:49,772 --> 02:13:52,650
This country needs a real leader...

2416
02:13:53,150 --> 02:13:55,777
...a man that can keep his promises...

2417
02:13:55,778 --> 02:13:58,864
...who is not afraid to face adversity.

2418
02:13:59,740 --> 02:14:01,116
I'm Carmelo Vargas...

2419
02:14:01,450 --> 02:14:05,454
...with your help, I'll become
the next President of the Republic.

2420
02:14:07,706 --> 02:14:09,625
Together, we will achieve it.

2421
02:14:15,297 --> 02:14:17,466
COALITION UNITED FOR MEXICO

2422
02:14:17,841 --> 02:14:20,176
Thank you for tuning in...

2423
02:14:20,177 --> 02:14:23,513
...tonight we have
some very special guests...

2424
02:14:23,514 --> 02:14:25,265
...and I want to welcome them.

2425
02:14:25,266 --> 02:14:29,018
Lucia, Salvador, Ana and Elena,
it's good to have you here.

2426
02:14:29,019 --> 02:14:30,979
Thank you, Ricardo for the invitation.

2427
02:14:30,980 --> 02:14:33,983
Salvador, how do you feel
after all you've lived through?

2428
02:14:34,275 --> 02:14:37,193
First of all, thank you
for the opportunity, Ricardo.

2429
02:14:37,194 --> 02:14:40,196
I have to admit that
my girls' kidnapping...

2430
02:14:40,197 --> 02:14:41,990
...has been one of the hardest and...

2431
02:14:41,991 --> 02:14:44,034
...most painful experiences in my life.

2432
02:14:44,285 --> 02:14:46,995
What I can assure you
is that in spite of it all...

2433
02:14:46,996 --> 02:14:49,622
...having the support
of your TV Network...

2434
02:14:49,623 --> 02:14:52,417
...and the commitment
and support of candidate...

2435
02:14:52,418 --> 02:14:55,712
...Carmelo Vargas, have allowed
me to recover the faith...

2436
02:14:55,713 --> 02:14:57,840
...and trust in the future of this country.

2437
02:14:58,090 --> 02:15:00,134
Thank you for your statement,
Salvador.

2438
02:15:00,384 --> 02:15:02,552
But you're not here to
talk about the kidnapping...

2439
02:15:02,553 --> 02:15:05,138
...are you, Lucia?
You want to share some...

2440
02:15:05,139 --> 02:15:07,766
- ...important news.
- That's right, Ricardo.

2441
02:15:08,100 --> 02:15:11,227
We want to announce to your viewers...

2442
02:15:11,228 --> 02:15:13,355
...that our daughters, Ana and Elena...

2443
02:15:13,731 --> 02:15:16,274
...will have the leading roles
in a soap opera...

2444
02:15:16,275 --> 02:15:18,068
...called "World of Joy"...

2445
02:15:18,444 --> 02:15:20,903
...that will air very soon...

2446
02:15:20,904 --> 02:15:23,197
...in prime time on your TV Network.

2447
02:15:23,198 --> 02:15:26,159
That is great news!
I'm sure it will be a success.

2448
02:15:26,160 --> 02:15:27,994
Do you mind if before we go...

2449
02:15:27,995 --> 02:15:29,746
...our future stars give us a small token...

2450
02:15:29,747 --> 02:15:32,291
- ...of their talent?
- Of course.

2451
02:16:20,005 --> 02:16:24,009
2 YEARS LATER...

2452
02:16:27,554 --> 02:16:28,972
<i>Citizens of Mexico...</i>

2453
02:16:30,224 --> 02:16:34,228
<i>...I do solemnly swear to protect...</i>

2454
02:16:34,812 --> 02:16:38,439
<i>...the Constitution
of the United Mexican States...</i>

2455
02:16:38,440 --> 02:16:40,401
<i>...and the laws emanating from it...</i>

2456
02:16:40,984 --> 02:16:42,361
<i>...to execute...</i>

2457
02:16:43,028 --> 02:16:45,280
<i>...loyally and patriotically...</i>

2458
02:16:45,698 --> 02:16:48,282
<i>...the duties of the
President of the Republic...</i>

2459
02:16:48,283 --> 02:16:49,993
<i>...that the people have conferred...</i>

2460
02:16:50,577 --> 02:16:55,457
<i>...upon me for the sake
and prosperity of the Union.</i>

2461
02:16:56,375 --> 02:16:58,209
<i>If I do not do so...</i>

2462
02:16:58,210 --> 02:17:00,295
<i>...the Nation will be my judge.</i>

2463
02:17:41,628 --> 02:17:45,048
THE PERFECT DICTATORSHIP

